#. inDungeon
msgctxt "597352"
msgid "Shut it. I'm preparing to go live!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598040"
msgid "I was sure the Labyrinth was going to look\nrehashed. She really did manage to avoid it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598592"
msgid "I-is this…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598628"
msgid "Blehhhh! D-Darling, this song is…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598772"
msgid "Her demonic song gouges out my entrails,\njolts my brain, and shakes my very soul."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598896"
msgid "…could anyone but her perpetrate such\na devilish act? No, I think not."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "598968"
msgid "Yes! The blood idol returns from Hell!\n#C236196003Elizabeth Báthory#CDEF: Encore Ver.!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "599776"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF… I can hardly believe it…\nDid you hear that, father? I may have\njust made my first frien―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "600808"
msgid "But this time it's different! I'M the #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF,\nwhich means I have the leading role!\nI'm not some Master's pawn this round!"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "601216"
msgid "Who's your new Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601356"
msgid "I'll only take top idol appropriate questions.\n\"What are your plans?\" \"How will you do this\nyear?\" Or maybe the truth about some scandal!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601640"
msgid "What I want to know is――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "601756"
msgid "Yeah, maybe I'll start by releasing my\nNEW single… It's titled\n\"Twintails and Jinxes.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602568"
msgid "That's way too ambitious…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "602684"
msgid "Could this idol actually be a GENIUS…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604316"
msgid "…so it seems.\nWhat's it like, having anyone and everyone\nmake advances on you?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604896"
msgid "My left hand faintly aches."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "604924"
msgid "…huh?\nNo way. This IS #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF,\nbut even she can't be THIS easy―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "605228"
msgid "But now she's asking for other questions…\nAll I wanted to know was who her Master is…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606172"
msgid "Huff… huff… now I get it.\nThis is the hate #RUBS   Sentinels#RUBElead actors#REND get.\nFine with me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606420"
msgid "Hahahahahahaha!\nLooks like it's my turn, at last!\nThe Great Master S has arrived! Hup!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606564"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606576"
msgid "Oh, I get it.\nBy \"interesting,\" she meant\nTHAT kind of \"interesting.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606648"
msgid "Hahahahahahahahahahahahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "606760"
msgid "Then #C236196003Shinji#CDEF is #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's new Master!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "607532"
msgid "Here's a complaint I want to make:\nwhy is my attendant such a dull rat?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608304"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF…\nPlease don't bring that up…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608652"
msgid "…regardless,\nthis isn't the time to be feeling down."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608876"
msgid "Gyaahffu!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "608892"
msgid "HEY! What's the big idea, #C236196003BB#CDEF!?\nThis is all HER fault!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609064"
msgid "There's no way I would ever attack you, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF.\nThe reason being―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609304"
msgid "Wha―――WHAT…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "609332"
msgid "Look here.\nIt annoys me to hear the same\nobvious fact over and over."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610720"
msgid "Excuse me, Seaweed? May you please\nnot bother my kind Darling with\nyour half-assery?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610904"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "610916"
msgid "Well then, I'll let you handle the rest.\nKing, be very careful not to let #C236196003Eli#CDEF's\nsecrets be stolen."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611172"
msgid "These are programs I designed for this level.\nYou guys are gonna game over instantly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611264"
msgid "So, show me your best struggle.\nThe game starts, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "611932"
msgid "That's the spirit, Darling!\nLet's put the fear of the GODS\ninto those insolent children!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "613448"
msgid "*kgh*… Well, even I didn't think this would\nbe enough to stop you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "614532"
msgid "Please don't jinx me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "615968"
msgid "Damn, a trap…!?\n―――Here it comes, Master!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616344"
msgid "*sigh*. Please, seriously. Enough of this.\nIt's a big drain on my HP and MP,\nconsidering my class. …hm, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616516"
msgid "I follow #C236196003#SVT#CDEF's gaze and look behind."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616652"
msgid "This is… #C236196003Sakura#CDEF, please check the\nLabyrinth's layout code."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616728"
msgid "Okay―――Ah, so there IS a spot with\nsome appended instructions. I think this is\n#C236196003Shinji#CDEF's gimmick."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "616948"
msgid "If you try to continue on, enemies will\nforcibly spawn like before and block\nyour path, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617688"
msgid "Well done.\nAll signs of the problem enemy are\ngone from the floor!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "617756"
msgid "Okay. We're all set to overwrite it!\nAaand… click."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "618284"
msgid "…………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619400"
msgid "I ask,\n\"What happened to #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "619464"
msgid "HUH? Seriously? You want to talk to THAT pest?\nTalking to her is a waste of time."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620196"
msgid "To some extent, hiding a #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF\ncould be considered the ideal defense."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "620972"
msgid "Uhhh………?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622148"
msgid "For me, I get an uneasy feeling that a very different\nflag is being set…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622232"
msgid "………pfft."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "622476"
msgid "Horns!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "623212"
msgid "We do NOT!"
msgstr ""

