#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650328"
msgid "After making a shortcut to the old school from\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF, please return to base."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650432"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you appear to have accumulated\na lot of fatigue. I recommend that\nyou return for the moment to take a rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650568"
msgid "I'm concerned about #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650612"
msgid "Searching the Labyrinth is nice and all,\nbut I should #C000246204return to the old school#CDEF to\nbriefly speak with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650752"
msgid "I obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's briefly return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and sort\nout the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650872"
msgid "First thing to do is activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nThat'll help move our search along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "650972"
msgid "We took more damage from our fight with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nthan I expected. Now would be a good time to head\nback to the old school.\nLuckily, there's a #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF near us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651164"
msgid "What's wrong, Praetor?\nLet's #C000246204continue onward#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651228"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll protect you, Darling.\nSo, continue on #C000246204ahead#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651308"
msgid "Surely you're not telling me that you're\nfrightened? Even you understand that stopping\nhere is impermissible, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651424"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. After you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nplease have yourself a rest in your\nprivate room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651552"
msgid "Even in cyberspace, you need proper rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651596"
msgid "Once you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nuse it to get back here.\nI'll bet you're exhausted, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651724"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, return to base for now.\nLet's discuss our plan\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651852"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.\nYou've accumulated a lot of fatigue;\nany more will be dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "651960"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's worried state gets across to\nme even over the transmission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652048"
msgid "She's right, it would be best if\nwe returned to the #C000246204Old School Building#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652140"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF. Let's return to the\n#C000246204Old School Building#CDEF for the time being.\nWe can come again after we recover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652288"
msgid "We got the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nMission complete.\nLet's head home and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652372"
msgid "Where are you going? We secured the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThere's nothing urgent to tend to.\nBack to #C000246204My Room#CDEF, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652504"
msgid "Hrrrm? Where are you going, #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF? Where are you going,\nleaving me behind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652604"
msgid "For a second there, I was thinking about\nleaving #C236196003Gatou#CDEF and heading back,\nbut it probably won't rest easy on my conscience,\nso let's turn back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652764"
msgid "Wait, Praetor. If we're going to head back,\nit'll behoove us for the future to have\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF activated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652892"
msgid "Master, let's look for the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nIt should be around here somewhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "652984"
msgid "We don't need to walk all the way back.\nWe can use the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF to reach the\nold school in a flash. Very nifty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653116"
msgid "M-my stomach is at its limit…\nI want to hurry back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653216"
msgid "Before we go to the next floor,\nlet's #C000246204head back to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nWe need to hand over the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF.\nHe gave his life to entrust us with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653424"
msgid "Huh? You're still in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nCome on, there's nothing to do there.\nGet your butt back here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653548"
msgid "We'll talk about what comes next tomorrow,\nso #C000246204come back and get some rest#CDEF.\nAfter, drop by the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653680"
msgid "We're in a race against time.\nWe need to hurry to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653772"
msgid "I can't let #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's hopes go to waste.\nLet's press on so we can catch up to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653896"
msgid "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "653976"
msgid "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654080"
msgid "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654168"
msgid "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "654288"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "654372"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "654452"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "654520"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "654560"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "654592"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "654624"
msgid "Return to the old school?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654652"
msgid "Straight from János Hill, I will descend～♪\nFrom up high, right to youuu～♪\nAaaand run you through, blood splatters too!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654776"
msgid "Ugh. This voice…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654796"
msgid "………it had completely escaped me―\nwhat THAT characteristic of hers is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654872"
msgid "Her unmatched singing voice is spoiled by\nher unmatched tone-deafness."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "654944"
msgid "Alright, are you ready?\nI'm going to K I L L  I T on every chart\nI'm not on鷙!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655024"
msgid "Here we meet once again. I expected no\nless from my rival. Even I can't compete\nwith your perseverance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655128"
msgid "However! If anyone is to be called an idol,\nit's ME! MY singing surpasses all\nHeroic Spirits, all artists!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655236"
msgid "That's the lesson I'm going to teach you!\nAnd forget the annoying panel of judges format―\nwe'll have the fans vote!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655356"
msgid "Heh… You're quite sensible, aren't you, #C236196003Saber#CDEF?\nThinking about it, sure.\nI approve of that format!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655472"
msgid "You know, I've thought that way for a long time.\nThey're called \"judges,\" but they don't\nunderstand my songs in the least."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655596"
msgid "I know. I know what you mean.\nYou too have been tormented by the plebeians\nwho care not for the arts."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655700"
msgid "Mhm. I know it's unwise,\nbut I'm going to say it:\n―――The two of us are frenemies!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655788"
msgid "N-no! You mustn't, #C236196003Eliza#CDEF! If I want to be the\ntop star, she'll be my greatest obstacle―――\nI can't be getting along with her…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "655936"
msgid "But as my rival,\nI'll be letting you hear my special, new songs.\nBe sure to look forward to it!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656032"
msgid "It's a little late for me to chime in,\nbut I agree with getting rid of the panel of judges format."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656132"
msgid "I mean, it's just such a shame to have judges.\nTrue harmony is letting only trained #RUBS     fans #RUBEsupporters#REND hype things up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656268"
msgid "But hey, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF. I know you haven't forgotten\nyour two losses to us. Aren't you at a\nbit of a disadvantage in this battle?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656408"
msgid "What chart would YOU be on? From when?\nSorry, but I don't recall seeing your name\npop up on even a single chart."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656524"
msgid "What do you mean \"Encore Ver.\"!? Come back after\nyou've at least swapped some colors. You don't\nlook like you're ANY tougher."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656652"
msgid "\"Kill it on the charts\"? You're quite resolute.\nBut the charts will turn from top 100 to top 0―\nAre you fine with that?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656776"
msgid "Hmph. That was just the start of my\nopening performance. I'd say every idol\nhas things they'd rather keep buried…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656892"
msgid "She's \"not an ordinary Servant\"…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "656928"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF proudly states,\nbut a contract with a Master ought to be\nessential to drawing out her power."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657048"
msgid "Besides, #C236196003BB#CDEF said she gave her an \"interesting Master.\"\nI don't think she'll give me a straight answer,\nbut I'll try asking."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657188"
msgid "Hmph. You're unbelievably third-rate.\nI can't have you oinking around for some\ngossip to write about me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657296"
msgid "Well, I only want to ask about your Mast―"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657340"
msgid "Actually, this may be a good opportunity to probe for her #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nMay as well ask a question while I have the chance."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "657472"
msgid "Ask about her upcoming plans."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "657504"
msgid "Ask about the truth behind her scandal."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "657544"
msgid "Isn't it embarrassing to appear THIS many times?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657596"
msgid "I came up with a ground-breaking idea.\nI'll stick an entry ticket on the packaging."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657680"
msgid "An entry ticket… for a meet-and-greet?\nAn autograph session?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657744"
msgid "Stop it, anything more is asking for trouble."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657792"
msgid "No. It'll grant you the privilege of\nbeing slapped by my prized tail."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657864"
msgid "Y-you'd have to be a diehard fan to want that!\nBut for some reason, I get the feeling that there\nare quite a few orders lined up!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "657996"
msgid "It fills a niche!\nSounds fun!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658028"
msgid "Targeting a specific audience?\nYou've really thought this through."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658096"
msgid "Can we change the title to\n\"GAL Sabbath～A Fool's Hell-Kaleidoscope\"?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658168"
msgid "It appears that her taste in music isn't the\nonly thing that's egregious. However,\nwhat's good is that it IS cunning."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658288"
msgid "It gets my stamp of approval.\nYour business has feet to stand on,\nyou degenerate dragon."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658380"
msgid "And that's not all. My next single will give\nthe privilege of being stabbed by my horns.\nThe next, to be torn by my claws."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658504"
msgid "Then we'll compare the number of entries,\nand have a general selection\nwith the use of my #RUBS         body  #RUBElethal weapons#REND…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658644"
msgid "No matter which part gets chosen,\nat the center of them all is a perdition named \"#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF\"…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658756"
msgid "Hee hee hee. Surprised you, didn't it? Actually,\nI also have a plan to form a group with sisters.\nOf course, every member will just be me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658896"
msgid "But, hee hee hee―――Hyah hee hee hee!\nWell done, #[piggy][squirrely]#. Well done."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "658980"
msgid "You instantly understood the charm of my plans!\nYou're more promising cattle than I thought!\nI lov―――err, erm, I kind of like you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659116"
msgid "Alright! I'm in a good mood,\nso I'll answer your previous question.\n\"Who is your Master,\" that one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659216"
msgid "Really!\nI want to know, I want to know!\nPlease tell me, oh Super Idol!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659288"
msgid "It's heartbreaking to watch this play out; her\nbeing deceived. You're leading her by the nose,\nPraetor. String her a little further along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659428"
msgid "…sorry, looks like I instantly got left\nbehind by all this excitement. Keep doing your\nthing, Master…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659532"
msgid "Kyaa! We wanna know! We wanna knoowwww!\nTell us #C236196003Eliza#CDEF, you sucker!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659616"
msgid "Mhm. I'm also curious.\nTell us of the prospects that await us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659680"
msgid "Gosh, what am I going to do with you, #[piggy][squirrely]#!\nSince I can't say no to those eyes,\nI'll tell you, as a super special service."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659820"
msgid "What a nice question. It's very much like what\nan idol would get! Romance is the biggest\ntaboo―it's natural to be curious about it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "659956"
msgid "Okay! Hound me, be nasty with your\ncross-examination! Bow before my \n#ROFS0001#RUBS skill in disregarding#RUBEcomplete silence#REND!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660092"
msgid "I'm thankful that she's so eager,\nbut I wasn't asking about the blood idol's scandals."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660180"
msgid "I just kinda went with the flow and\nasked something that sounded appropriate…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660260"
msgid "Then indulge me with some ad lib. Ask\nsomething like―yeah, to catch me off guard…\n\"Is it true you have the hots for #[piggy][squirrely]#?\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660404"
msgid "#[Piggy][Squirrely]#…?\n#[Piggy][Squirrely]#, as in… #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660492"
msgid "Wait, #C236196003Lancer#CDEF! I tolerate gossipping about love\naffairs, but I can't allow this one. Just how\nmuch of my rival do you intend to become!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660644"
msgid "Huhhh? What are you TALKING about?\nThe person in question flat out rejects you,\ndone. Make funnier jokes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660752"
msgid "Hm? Is that true? …you move swiftly,\n#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. Also, you have no standards.\nEven the #C236196003King of Heroes#CDEF is disgusted."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660900"
msgid "Dummy. That was obviously just an example.\nI told you to \"catch me off guard,\" didn't I?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "660992"
msgid "All you can do is be plain, making me look\nbetter; you look like you would do anything I\nsay; and make for an innocent #[butler][maid]#… huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661136"
msgid "Could it be? Are #[piggy][squirrely]# and me surprisingly\ncompatible…?\nDo we happen to be a good match…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661244"
msgid "――――Ah! There's no way cattle can be\na good match for me. I don't even need to keep\nit a secret. It's out of the question."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661372"
msgid "This won't do. It turned out to be\nsurprisingly silly. Don't you have any\nother questions?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661464"
msgid "The aching in my hand stopped.\nApparently, it WAS too early to expose her secrets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661548"
msgid "My Master… Frankly, I'm not very willing to\nanswer. But if I don't say it, you'll bother\nme about it later… Fine. I'll tell you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661680"
msgid "You're pretending to ask a question\njust to embarrass me! I-I'm not embarrassed!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661764"
msgid "Firstly, do you HAVE to phrase it like that?\nThis is my long-awaited reappearance――\nmy re-release, my \"best of\" edition!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661888"
msgid "Still, this pacing is a little fast. Or rather…\nWell, frankly, there isn't any value in it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "661984"
msgid "And yeah, I do get the feeling that having the same outfit\nis what's making this feel like a rehash."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662088"
msgid "EVERYBODY keeps harping on about the #ROFS0002#RUBS   model#RUBEexterior#REND!\nDo you have no words for what's important―\nthe #RUBS   stats#RUBEinterior#REND?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662248"
msgid "The reason my appearance is the same is because\nit's so perfect it CAN'T change. The designers\nare the ones who lose out!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662372"
msgid "Then I'd like for her to at least change her name or something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662436"
msgid "Like, #C236196003Elizabeth Custom#CDEF.\nOr like, #C236196003Elizabeth Zero#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662520"
msgid "That's got nothing to do with dragons!\nYou do intend for ME to be summoned, right!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662604"
msgid "Then I'll just have to call that guy in.\nWhat I need now is the straight-man I always\nhave with me…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662708"
msgid "I don't want to do this, but…\ncome on, #RUBSattendant#RUBEMaster#REND!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662780"
msgid "Hm? If I recall correctly, this guy was…\nRider's walking wallet… or something."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662864"
msgid "My eyes must be tricking me. There's NO WAY."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662912"
msgid "That's #C236196003Shinji Matou#CDEF―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "662956"
msgid "Yep. Though I'm not too happy about\ngetting stuck with another red and loud woman."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663040"
msgid "I should be able to make good use of her,\ndespite that. #C236196003BB#CDEF came crying to me, begging.\nSo I agreed to go along with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663176"
msgid "I'm shocked… At what point did you double-cross\nus? Going for number one in most scummy\nand hopeless as usual, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663296"
msgid "Heh. Unlike you all, I―――\nyou idiots get swept up by your emotions, but I\ndon't. This is the result of a calm decision."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663420"
msgid "Do it, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. Declare your surrender!\nI, the Game Champ of Asia―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663508"
msgid "So there you have it. Honestly, I miss #C236196003Rin#CDEF\nand #C236196003Rani#CDEF. They also had their problems, but\ntheir looks suited my tastes."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663660"
msgid "D-don't interrupt me to start complaining!\nDon't you have any manners, \"aristocrat\"!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663748"
msgid "Ha. Haven't you seen your own results?\nAll you've done is lose, so I, a genius, was\nscouted out to come help you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663864"
msgid "Huh? \"Genius\"? You just happened to be\n\"scouted out\" while you were quivering with\nfear in a corner of the Labyrinth!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "663984"
msgid "*kgh*. That's rich, coming from you.\nYou were in a corner of the Imaginary Number\nSpace―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664080"
msgid "AHHH AHHH! I can't understand sounds\nfrom lifeforms lower than cattle!\nThis dumb rat SURE is annoying!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664184"
msgid "Wha-dum…!?\nYou're that one that's dumb! Dummy, dummy!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664240"
msgid "What's your deal!? Dummy, dummy, dummy!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664284"
msgid "While ignoring our existence,\nthese two repeat their #RUBS   \"Dummy!\"#RUBEbickerings#REND ad infinitum."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664388"
msgid "…this is awful. Awful in a lot of ways."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664432"
msgid "I don't think I was like that when I was in his\nplace… Maybe being a Master affects you in some\nway. What do you think, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664584"
msgid "What do you mean, #C236196003Sakura#CDEF? …hey, #C236196003Rani#CDEF!\nDon't give her that look of comprehension!\nI'm no member of the PITY PARTY!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664732"
msgid "An angry voice over the transmission rings in my ears.\nWhether here or there, awful things are everywhere."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664840"
msgid "I knew I had things to worry about without #C236196003Leo#CDEF here―――\nno, actually, this would be even more awful if he was here."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "664976"
msgid "We need to end this bickering so we can\nprobe for #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665076"
msgid "Ahem. Kids who talk too much get a piece of\n#C236196003BB#CDEF's Slam of Justice～!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665160"
msgid "Oops… It just sorta, happened.\nUmm, ahem. Sorry about that, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF.\nMy hand slipped."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665264"
msgid "For YOU are the strongest Master, surpassing\n#C236196003Leo Bistario Harwey#CDEF, humanity's greatest #ROFS0001#RUBS  Magus#RUBE#C000246204Wizard#CDEF#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665424"
msgid "As long as I have a Servant,\nI'm the one who can win the #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665516"
msgid "You know this, don't you, #C236196003BB#CDEF:\nconsidering who I am, you'll be paying me what\nI deserve for helping you out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665640"
msgid "Yes, it's already been worked out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665676"
msgid "Once I reach the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF,\nthe Near Side #C000246204Moon Cell#CDEF will be transferred to…\nPardon, I will humbly offer it to you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665832"
msgid "If anyone is fit to be King of the Moon,\nit's you, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "665908"
msgid "Heh―――Heheh, hahahaha! Yep, that's right!\nI'm one of the chosen ones, the last-standing\nwinner!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666008"
msgid "#C236196003BB#CDEF's coaxing turns #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's grimace into a smile."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666092"
msgid "His expression is condescending.\nIt's #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's usual expression.\nEven though I'm used to seeing it,\nthis time it has a hint of desperation―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666256"
msgid "Maybe it's because I saw with my own two eyes\nhow his #C000246204Holy Grail War#CDEF ended…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666352"
msgid "It matters not in the slightest who turns\nagainst us. Whoever the opponent is, I need only\nto do my best for you, #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666500"
msgid "However… Facing #C236196003Shinji#CDEF again must be painful\nfor you. It's a little distressing, knowing\nwhat will happen after our victory."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666644"
msgid "…#C236196003Shinji Matou#CDEF may be shallow, but he's a\nclever man. Normally, he wouldn't fall for such\nblatant smooth talking… normally."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666788"
msgid "Recalling the reality he got hit with, I get his\nwishful thinking… but why doesn't he realize\nthat he's making things harder for himself?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "666928"
msgid "*sigh*. This person truly is hopeless.\nThat's why he's so childish.\n…wait, he actually is a child, isn't he?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667040"
msgid "What's daunting you? There's no other\nopponent who can be as easily defeated in all\nof mind, skill, and body."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667152"
msgid "Hmph. I'll show you that I can easily protect my\nown secrets, without relying on this RAT."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667244"
msgid "Now. The opening talk ends here.\nLet my revival concert shake you to the core!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667324"
msgid "This time, victory WILL be MINE.\nYes… definitely."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667376"
msgid "The two disappear.\nThey probably left and went to the\ninterior of the Labyrinth."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667460"
msgid "There are signs of multiple enemies.\nIt appears they may take some time to\ndeal with…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667548"
msgid "They're nothing more than a mishmash of widgets.\nThey can't stop you with your current\nstrength. …isn't that right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667668"
msgid "Obviously.\nAnd now we ended up with another goal:\nbring #C236196003Shinji#CDEF to his senses."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667764"
msgid "We can't back down now.\nEven if it just happened to be temporarily configured in us,\nhe and I have an unsavory tie to one another."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "667896"
msgid "Mhm! This will become a final battle\nwith my fated rival for me as well!\nLet's rally ourselves, Master!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668000"
msgid "Don't you get worried either.\nIt's the same old Labyrinth exploration.\nFocus up, and let's go."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668096"
msgid "An \"unsavory tie,\" huh? Then it must be done.\nThis performance is uninspiring, but I'll go\nalong with it, for your sake."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668220"
msgid "Upon advancing into the Labyrinth,\nwe approach a hill with enemies huddled on it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668304"
msgid "They're tightly packed into the thin path,\nso we can't avoid them.\nThis malicious setup is―――definitely #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's doing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668444"
msgid "Nice, you look real fed up!\nThanks for giving me the reaction\nI was hoping for, #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668548"
msgid "These guys are as sturdy as it gets.\nEven if you beat one, will you have the stamina\nto climb up? I call this the―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668668"
msgid "It breaks your heart with a CRACK:\nthe hearthrob ☆ Golem-covered Hill of Hell!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668748"
msgid "Again with your bull! And you're overdoing it\nwith the \"heartthrob\"! Agh… Anyway, come up\nthe hill and show me how you pant like a dog!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668888"
msgid "………somehow, we climbed all the way up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "668932"
msgid "It looks like the Labyrinth still continues further,\nbut I guess we made it past the first hurdle."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669032"
msgid "Obviously.\nIt would've been troubling if he DID think\nthis would be enough to stop #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669148"
msgid "#C236196003Leo#CDEF entrusted everything to me.\nNo matter how ordinary or straightforward\nmy solutions may be,\nstopping in my tracks is the one thing I won't do."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669312"
msgid "! ………\n(What? That look in #[his][her]# eyes just now…\n#[He][She]# looks kind of―cool…)"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669408"
msgid "Wh-what's going on here……?\nYou're acting kind of funny."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669468"
msgid "Anyway, don't think that this floor ends here!\nWhoever wins in the END is the winner!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669556"
msgid "*sigh* …how terribly dull.\nI get no sense of artistry in his actions. As\nif cheap tricks will stop my #RUBS  Master#RUBEPraetor#REND and I."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669700"
msgid "Praetor's been in high spirits ever since\nreclaiming me against all odds! I'm just falling\ndeeper and deeper in love by the second!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669832"
msgid "That makes me feel a little worried for\nfuture me…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "669884"
msgid "#C236196003Saber#CDEF's words inspire me and make me more aware of myself.\nSince she approves of me, I only want to take actions\nthat I can be proud of."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670040"
msgid "…let's go. The Labyrinth continues on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670080"
msgid "Whoever wins in the end is the winner, huh?\nThat applies to him just as much."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670160"
msgid "But you're looking pretty resolute now.\nHopefully that won't invite more ladies to\ncause you trouble."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670264"
msgid "I'm certain that if periods of getting lucky\nwith the ladies exist in life,\nit comes at a cost, in unthinkable ways…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670384"
msgid "Still, it doesn't feel so bad to be\npraised by the usually sarcastic #C236196003Archer#CDEF, that's for sure.\nSince he approves of me, I only want to take\nactions that I can be proud of."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670572"
msgid "…let's go. The Labyrinth continues on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670612"
msgid "But you've become a lot bolder.\nCompared to #C236196003Shinji#CDEF, this look in your eyes\nis a lot manlie―――ow! Don't kick me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670744"
msgid "Then don't say things that deserve kicks!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670788"
msgid "Maybe it's about time that #C236196003Archer#CDEF fell into some\nlady troubles of his own."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "670880"
msgid "Don't start scaring me. This has been plenty…\nIsn't it enough…? More importantly,\ncome on. Let's get back to the exploration."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671008"
msgid "Ah. He ran away.\nI'll be sure to get an apology out of him for this later―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671088"
msgid "In the meantime, I'll focus on exploring the Labyrinth.\nThe path still continues on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671176"
msgid "He's so minor and unimportant, it's actually\nrefreshing. Well, let's just be careful not to\nlet ourselves get tripped up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671300"
msgid "But more importantly… Your soul is so handsome,\nit's becoming lethal territory. Please be\ncareful… in more ways than one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671424"
msgid "…I don't quite get what she means,\nbut I'll be careful. In more ways than one."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671504"
msgid "#C236196003Caster#CDEF's words inspire me and make me more aware of myself."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671580"
msgid "I'm not sure how I feel about my soul being handsome,\nto be honest, but since she approves of me, I only want to take\nactions that I can be proud of."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671732"
msgid "…let's go. The Labyrinth continues on."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671772"
msgid "Hrm? What's the meaning of this?\n―――It's coming for us, Master!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671840"
msgid "Woah! What's this all of a sudden!?\n―――#RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND, prepare for battle!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "671936"
msgid "Oh? I believe this is some sort of plot.\nShall we start by routing this, Master?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672020"
msgid "Really? Just how dull can something be?\nFighting weaklings over and over will\nbore me. …hm?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672116"
msgid "No problem. But that was a fairly big\nalarm for something so lacking. …oh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672192"
msgid "…its presence remains.\nDoes this mean it's still alive?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672252"
msgid "There, I see enemies popping up one after the other.\nThe same kind of enemy as the one we just destroyed."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672360"
msgid "Let me take a look.\nAh. It's annoyingly sneaky and verbose―\nThis is Shinji's doing, all right."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672456"
msgid "That sure is annoying.\nHe was even nice enough to make a wall come out…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672532"
msgid "We'll overwrite the code giving you trouble."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672580"
msgid "However, it's difficult to overwrite the enemy\nwe want to delete if too many of the same type\nof enemy remain on the floor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672704"
msgid "There should be #C0002462043 enemies#CDEF of #C000246204exactly the same\nform#CDEF as the one you just subdued.\nPlease quickly subdue the rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672848"
msgid "Please stay calm, #[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF.\nWe have yet to complete our removal of these\nforced spawns."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "672964"
msgid "To help us remove it, first look around for\n#C000246204enemies of the exact same form#CDEF\nand subdue them all."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd
msgctxt "673076"
msgid "Continue to the next floor?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "673104"
msgid "Continue to the next floor."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd
msgctxt "673132"
msgid "Return to the previous floor?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "673164"
msgid "Return to previous floor."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "673192"
msgid "Return to the old school."
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "673220"
msgid "My blade won't be stopped by such fodder!\nLet's scatter them, Master!"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "673292"
msgid "3 of them… It's annoying, but not difficult.\nLet's get this over with, Master!"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "673372"
msgid "That's so like that Shinji!\nLet's make quick work of this mess, #RUBS  Master#RUBEDarling#REND!"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "673468"
msgid "This is the rubbish they present before us?\nIt's about quality, not the quantity!"
msgstr ""

#. inDungeon
msgctxt "673552"
msgid "Hey, I thought I told you not to act on your――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673604"
msgid "We reach the bottom of a long staircase.\nA vast, sunken sanctuary lies in this depth\nbelow even the ocean floor."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673720"
msgid "This isn't like the Spiritron ocean we're used to…\nIt's suffocating, as if the oxygen is thin here.\nI reflexively take a deep breath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673856"
msgid "―――We're definitely getting close to the Core."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "673908"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, can you hear me?\n…looks like there's no issue\nwith our connection."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674012"
msgid "The space density has gone up a notch. It\ndoesn't seem like it'll hinder your movements…\nbut it may be a little uncomfortable."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674140"
msgid "Have no fear, Praetor. I'm with you.\nIt matters not whether we're\nin abyssal depths or on the Appian Way."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674248"
msgid "No need to push yourself. In the end, it's\nan extension of the Arena, even if its shape\nis different. You're accustomed to it now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674380"
msgid "No worries, Darling♪\nMy tail is here if you ever become uneasy.\nGo on, let the fluffiness relax you!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674484"
msgid "It matters not. All #RUBS   mental phenomenon#RUBEthis effect#REND is\ncapable of is merely attempt to refuse us.\nTrampling over it should be amusing."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674636"
msgid "#C236196003#SVT#CDEF's words are reassuring.\nI take a step forward to shake off\nthe damp air clinging to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674748"
msgid "…appended code was successfully deleted.\nNow that bothersome gimmick can't be\nactivated again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674844"
msgid "That's good to hear.\nRunning around and playing tag with\nthese enemies paid off."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "674928"
msgid "Still, I haven't the slightest idea how difficult\nit was to overwrite the Labyrinth's architecture,\nthough they pulled it off so casually."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675068"
msgid "Don't worry. This is our field of expertise.\nWe made you a promise―――\nto provide you with perfect support."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675180"
msgid "Yep, yep. You knocked it out of the park\nyourself, even though just yesterday your body\nwas all messed up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675288"
msgid "Mhm. #[He][She]# may look like a delicate pet,\nbut that absolutely unbreakable heart of #[his][hers]# is\nwhat makes my Praetor so great."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675428"
msgid "And the various dangerous aspects of #[his][hers]# are\nalso great! #[He][She]#'s why the phrase \"keep an\neye on #[him][her]#\" exists. Mhm."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675568"
msgid "Absolutely. #[He][She]#'s got an A-Rank in tenacity,\nthat's for sure. Being reckless is what\nmakes #[him][her]# stand out."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675692"
msgid "That's a given. My Darling may look passive,\nbut #[he][she]#'s actually ravenous. …or maybe\nindifferent? Anyway, that's why鷙"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675820"
msgid "Don't criticize #[him][her]# for it.\nThis Master's only merit is how tough #[he][she]# is.\nHigh expectations can be harsh on a person."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "675956"
msgid "Hmph. What's your deal?\nAwfully cheerful, aren't we?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676012"
msgid "Suddenly, I hear #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's voice cut in.\nApparently, he's been monitoring our movements again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676124"
msgid "I know. I can't keep you at bay even with all\nthese trash mobs. Well, it'd be bad for ME if\nyou don't get strong enough to handle it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676260"
msgid "In order to make this game fair, I have\njust the right strategy set up. It'll be\nanti-climactic if you can't handle it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676380"
msgid "If he's going out of his way to send his signal to us,\nhe may be panicking on the inside."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676472"
msgid "But what concerns me more than #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's mental state is―――\n#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF, who loves the limelight,\nhasn't joined in on the conversation yet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676644"
msgid "We won't be able to find our way to an #C000246204SG#CDEF\nby only ever talking to #C236196003Shinji#CDEF,\nwhose gimmick we overcame well enough."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676792"
msgid "Rather than wanting to talk to her,\nI want to meet with her.\nI have to meet with her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676880"
msgid "In order to progress through the Labyrinth,\nwe need her secrets."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "676948"
msgid "Hmph. As if I would let you meet her.\nIf she screws up, we'll be forced to lose."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677032"
msgid "Hey, #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF.\nIf you get what I'm saying then\njust sit tight. …………hey."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677128"
msgid "Why are you tracing your fingers on the wall?\nAnd like, what's with the cutesy smile?\nI don't get what you're doing, dude!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677252"
msgid "W-well, whatever.\nIn any case, don't think that this is over!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677316"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF ends his transmission,\nleaving behind a silence that's extremely\nuncomfortable for some reason."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677436"
msgid "Something definitely just happened then.\nFor now, there's no change on the radar."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677520"
msgid "However, a #C000246204Sentinel#CDEF is the Labyrinth's Core.\nIt's not possible to completely detach\nfrom the floor, to perfectly hide."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677656"
msgid "That's how it is. So, we'll leave it at that,\nand you can restart your explora―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677744"
msgid "Please wait!\n…#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF. At 10 o'clock from your position,\ncan you see a stone pillar?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677848"
msgid "What's over there?\nHey… This reading is―when did she―!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "677908"
msgid "The strained voices of the Student Council Room\ncause #C236196003#SVT#CDEF to take position."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678004"
msgid "Carefully, only our gazes move diagonally.\n―――From a gap in the crumbled sanctuary,\nwe spy red frills."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678112"
msgid "What's going on…?\nWhat's this mean…?\nWhat's the matter with me―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678184"
msgid "I thought maybe I was just seeing things\nback there, so I came to double check…\nBut for some reason, I feel really…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678304"
msgid "Has she not noticed us staring at her?\nHer palms are on her cheeks,\nand her tied-up hair is swaying from side to side."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678424"
msgid "AND #[he][she]# wants to meet me…\n#[He][She]# said #[he][she]# wants to meet…\nThat animal doesn't know #[his][her]# place!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678552"
msgid "It's too direct, too passionate, too daring…\nYou would normally first send a letter,\nthen check our schedules…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678668"
msgid "Once you verify the date with fortune telling,\nyou casually draft a reply, run into each other\nat the ball, then say okay to meeting up. No?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678812"
msgid "…jeez, what am I even imagining…?\nThat won't happen. It won't.\nWhat if it doesn't happen!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "678908"
msgid "I'm an IDOL!\nWhat am I thinking, replying so easily!?\nI have to protect the value of my brand…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679008"
msgid "…I wonder if it's alright for me to call out to her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679064"
msgid "I keep tossing glances at #C236196003#SVT#CDEF,\nbut #SVT[she][he][she][he]# just keeps shaking #SVT[her][his][her][his]# head,\nas if saying, \"give me a break.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679224"
msgid "―――\"Let me take it from here,\"\nis what that apparently means."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679292"
msgid "Being a little confused, I take a step forward to\ncall out to her―――\nRight at that moment, #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF clenches her fist tight."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679440"
msgid "Alright! That settles it! Yeah, yeah!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679480"
msgid "I'm an idol,\nand the #ROFS0004#RUBS      Sentinel#RUBEleading actress#REND on this stage!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679572"
msgid "If #[he][she]# says #[he][she]# wants to meet,\nthen I'll welcome #[him][her]# on my special stage!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679672"
msgid "My set will be… yeah, that should do the trick.\nMaybe I should do my nails in a different color?\nAh! Will I make it in time!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679800"
msgid "Hrm!? She mentioned a special stage! The sound\nof it sends one's heart aflutter, doesn't it?\nI'll be seeing what my rival is made of."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679936"
msgid "That's what she reacts to……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "679968"
msgid "Don't look at me like that… Don't look at me with PITY…!\nI thought I told him to stop with the shit-eating grins…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680088"
msgid "…so you know, just in case, just to be sure,\nyou DO prefer beast ears, correct?\nAnd not horns, heretical as they are?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680208"
msgid "I-I don't know what she's going for with that question,\nbut I think #C236196003Caster#CDEF's ears are fluffy and superb.\nSoft things are adorable and put me at ease."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680376"
msgid "…yep, way more than horns. For sure."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680416"
msgid "Is that indeed so!? Gosh, I found this little\ndevelopment to be VERY disagreeable, so a short\nbout of suspicion came over me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680544"
msgid "In any case, it's a good thing this didn't\nsuddenly turn into a battle. But…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680624"
msgid "What's the matter, Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680676"
msgid "Hm. I feel like I sort of see what her #C000246204SG#CDEF\nis after hearing that monologue…\nDaydreamer? Deluded? No…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680796"
msgid "I get the feeling that there are quite a lot of\ngirls like her. Sorry though. I have no proof,\nso can you go gather a little more intel?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "680936"
msgid "It's completely incomprehensible to me.\nPerhaps #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF and Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF really DO\nhave the same patterns of thought…"
msgstr ""

